WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.609
A Claude Code session, saved as JSONL: one record per line.

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:07.810
Unroll opens the same file as a conversation.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:12.489
Tool calls show their arguments and link to their results.

00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:16.419
Any message can show the JSON record it came from.

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:22.729
Or open that line in the file, beside the preview.

00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:28.969
Search messages, tool names, arguments and results.

00:00:28.969 --> 00:00:36.049
Leave it open while a session runs. New lines appear as they’re written.

00:00:36.049 --> 00:00:45.339
Chat datasets work too. Pick a conversation to read it.

00:00:45.339 --> 00:00:47.739
Unroll for Visual Studio Code
